silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_6_g_arrow#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode6 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode6 is the schema-arrow g: B -> C, concretely the typed verb-arrow hasBodyMass: DomesticCat -> BodyMassQuality in the Mittens olog. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'g_arrow', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
